OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACameras plea after speed bumps
OL,4,Aplan 'downgraded'
OL,5,
OL,6,FVillagers set to have speed bumps added
OL,7,Fto their High Street have called for
OL,8,Faverage speed cameras to be installed
OL,9,Finstead.
OL,11,FRipley residents said the proposed
OL,12,F"speed cushions" in their village -
OL,13,Fwhich were originally due to be larger
OL,14,Fspeed tables - would not be enough to
OL,15,Fsufficiently reduce congestion and
OL,16,Fspeeding.
OL,18,FNational Highways is required to
OL,19,Fundertake traffic calming works in the
OL,20,FSurrey village under terms of the
OL,21,Fplanning consent for changes to the
OL,22,Fnearby junction 10 on the M25.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
