OL,3,GNEWSACameras plea after speed bumps
OL,4,Aplan 'downgraded'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe agency said it was "committed to
OL,7,Fdelivering traffic calming measures"
OL,8,Fand had "worked closely with the local
OL,9,Fcommunity to shape a design that meets
OL,10,Fthe project's requirements".
